# AutoFlow — example env vars (Steps 1 + 3)
# Copy these names into Vercel -> Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables.
# NEVER commit real keys to git. NEVER share keys in chat.
# Get the Supabase values from Supabase Dashboard -> Settings -> API.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Step 3 chatbot: server-only (NOT NEXT_PUBLIC_). The /api/chat route
# reads this on the server only; it never reaches frontend code.
# Get it from Google AI Studio (free tier). Without it, the chatbot
# still answers the three suggested questions from the user's real
# data, but other questions return a plain "AI unavailable" error.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
